# Line endings.
# Every text file is stored and checked out with Unix line endings (LF), also on Windows. The compiled
# JavaScript checked by moodle-plugin-ci (grunt) and the Moodle coding style require LF: a file checked
# out with Windows line endings (CRLF) and rebuilt would differ from the one in the repository.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files: never converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.zip binary

# Files excluded from the archives generated by GitHub (releases, Download ZIP).
/docs export-ignore
